<section>
<h2>GitHub Secrets i bezpieczeństwo</h2>
<ul>
<li>Token GH: <code>GH_TOKEN</code> do automatycznego otwierania PR</li>
<li>Opcjonalnie klucze API dla S3/Prometheus</li>
<li>Nie commituj artefaktów ani sekretów</li>
<li>Git LFS dla dużych plików JSON</li>
<li>Pre-commit: flake8, black, trailing-whitespace, end-of-file-fixer</li>
</ul>
</section>

<section>
<h2>Workflow GitHub Actions</h2>
<h3>CI (lint, test, walidacja)</h3>
<pre>
name: CI
on:
  push:
    branches: [ main, 'ultra-agent-dev' ]
  pull_request:
    paths:
      - 'src/**'
jobs:
  build:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    env:
      GH_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GH_TOKEN }}
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v3
      - uses: actions/setup-python@v4
        with: python-version: 3.10
      - run: pip install -r requirements-dev.txt
      - run: pre-commit run --all-files
      - run: pytest
      - run: python Scenariusze/validate_super_agent.py --schema Konfiguracje/super_agent_schema.json --partial częściowe/partial.json
</pre>

<h3>Preview artefaktu</h3>
<pre>
name: Preview Generate
on:
  workflow_dispatch:
    inputs:
      preview_size:
        description: 'Number of records to preview'
        required: false
jobs:
  generate-preview:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v3
      - uses: actions/setup-python@v4
        with: python-version: 3.10
      - run: pip install -r requirements-dev.txt
      - run: |
          python Scenariusze/generate_super_agent.py --partial częściowe/partial.json --preview ${{ github.event.inputs.preview_size }}
      - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v3
        with:
          name: super-agent-preview
          path: artefakty/super-agent-preview.json
</pre>
</section>

